# ACLED conflict event data (optional but highly recommended for conflict/military questions)
# Register free at: https://developer.acleddata.com
# ACLED_API_KEY=your_key_here
# ACLED_EMAIL=your_email_here

# No LLM or API keys required for the core pipeline.
# Data sources used (all free, no auth):
#   GDELT  — https://api.gdeltproject.org  (global news events, tone scores)
#   RSS    — Reuters, BBC, Al Jazeera, France24
#   Metaculus — https://www.metaculus.com  (community forecasts, currently 403)
#   Polymarket — https://gamma-api.polymarket.com  (prediction market prices)
